A partial sale with different available SEK unit costs still needs an explicit lot cost.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 First purchase
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -200 SEK

2024-01-02 Second purchase at a different unit cost
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {150 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -450 SEK

2024-01-03 Ambiguous partial sale without a lot cost
  Assets:Fund  -1 FUND @ 200 SEK
  Assets:Cash  200 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Negative FUND posting must use both a lot cost ({...} or {{...}}) and a transaction price (@ or @@); the default commodity is SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:18:3
